);
COMMENT ON TABLE bid_options_audience_multipliers IS 'This represents a mapping from Audience ID to a bid price change value. This is paired with the bid_multipliers schedule type  Values represent the change in bid price and can be positive or negative. For percentage changes, a value of 500.0 means a 5% change. For value changes, the amount represents the direct bid adjustment. All audience multipliers must be set at the same time. If a multiplier is not provided it is assumed to be 0 (no bid adjustment). The change must still remain between the range of 0 and 10.. Original model name - BidOptionsAudienceMultipliers.';

