COMMENT ON TABLE conversion_events_data_items_custom_data IS 'Object containing other custom data.. Original model name - ConversionEventsDataItemsCustomData.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN conversion_events_data_items_custom_data.content_brand IS 'The brand of the content associated with the event.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN conversion_events_data_items_custom_data.content_category IS 'The category of the content associated with the event.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN conversion_events_data_items_custom_data.content_ids IS 'List of products IDs. We recommend using this if you are a merchant for PageVisit, AddToCart and Checkouts. For detail, please check [here](https://help.pinterest.com/en/business/article/before-you-get-started-with-catalogs) (Install the Pinterest tag section).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN conversion_events_data_items_custom_data.content_name IS 'The name of the page or product associated with the event.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN conversion_events_data_items_custom_data.contents IS 'A list of objects containing information about products, such as price and quantity. We recommend using this if you are a merchant for PageVisit, AddToCart and Checkouts. For detail, please check [here](https://help.pinterest.com/en/business/article/before-you-get-started-with-catalogs) (Install the Pinterest tag section).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN conversion_events_data_items_custom_data.currency IS 'The ISO-4217 currency code. If not provided, we will default to the advertiser&#39;s currency set during account creation. Your campaign performance needs this field to report right ROAS/CPA.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN conversion_events_data_items_custom_data.external_measurement_id IS 'Only use when instructed.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN conversion_events_data_items_custom_data.external_measurement_vendor_id IS 'Only use when instructed.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN conversion_events_data_items_custom_data.np IS 'Named partner. Not required, this is for Pinterest internal use only. Please do not use this unless specifically guided.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN conversion_events_data_items_custom_data.num_items IS 'Total number of products of the event. For example, the total number of items purchased in a checkout event. We recommend using this if you are a merchant for AddToCart and Checkouts. For detail, please check [here](https://help.pinterest.com/en/business/article/before-you-get-started-with-catalogs) (Install the Pinterest tag section).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN conversion_events_data_items_custom_data.opt_out_type IS 'Flags for different privacy rights laws to opt out users of sharing personal information. Separate values with commas. See the Help Center article about [limited data processing](https://help.pinterest.com/en/business/article/limited-data-processing) and the developer&#39;s guide for [tracking conversion events](/docs/track-conversions/track-conversions-in-the-api/#whether-the-user-has-opted-out-of-web-or-offline-conversion-events) for help with using this parameter.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN conversion_events_data_items_custom_data.order_id IS 'The order ID. We recommend sending order_id to help us deduplicate events when necessary. This also helps to run other measurement products at Pinterest.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN conversion_events_data_items_custom_data.predicted_ltv IS 'Predicted lifetime value of user associated with the event. Accepted as a string in the request; it will be parsed into a double.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN conversion_events_data_items_custom_data.search_string IS 'The search string related to the user conversion event.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN conversion_events_data_items_custom_data."value" IS 'Total value of the event. Accepted as a string in the request; it will be parsed into a double. For example, if there are two items in a checkout event, the value should be the total price. We recommend to use pre-tax, pre-shipping final value.';

