COMMENT ON COLUMN item_attributes.free_shipping_limit IS 'The minimum order purchase necessary for the customer to get free shipping. Only relevant if free shipping is offered.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN item_attributes.gender IS 'The gender associated with the product. Must be one of the following values (upper or lowercased): &#39;male&#39;, &#39;female&#39;, or &#39;unisex&#39;.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN item_attributes.google_product_category IS 'The categorization of the product based on the standardized Google Product Taxonomy. This is a set taxonomy. Both the text values and numeric codes are accepted.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN item_attributes."id" IS '&lt;&#x3D; 127 characters. The user-created unique ID that represents the product. Only Unicode characters are accepted.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN item_attributes.installment_price IS 'Installment price of the product. Expected format: &lt;payment_count&gt;:&lt;payment_amount&gt; &lt;currency&gt;';
COMMENT ON COLUMN item_attributes.ios_deep_link IS 'The deep link to the product on the iOS app.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN item_attributes.item_group_id IS '&lt;&#x3D; 127 characters. The parent ID of the product.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN item_attributes.last_updated_time IS 'The millisecond timestamp when the item was lastly modified by the merchant.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN item_attributes."link" IS '&lt;&#x3D; 511 characters. The landing page for the product.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN item_attributes.material IS 'The material used to make the product.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN item_attributes.min_ad_price IS 'The minimum advertised price of the product. It supports the following formats: \&quot;19.99 USD\&quot;, \&quot;19.99USD\&quot; and \&quot;19.99\&quot;. If the currency is not included, we default to US dollars.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN item_attributes.mobile_link IS 'The mobile-optimized version of your landing page. Must begin with http:// or https://.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN item_attributes.mpn IS 'Manufacturer Part Number are alpha-numeric codes created by the manufacturer of a product to uniquely identify it among all products from the same manufacturer.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN item_attributes.number_of_ratings IS 'The number of ratings for the item.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN item_attributes.number_of_reviews IS 'The number of reviews available for the item.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN item_attributes."pattern" IS 'The description of the pattern used for the product.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN item_attributes.price IS 'The price of the product. It supports the following formats: \&quot;24.99 USD\&quot;, \&quot;24.99USD\&quot; and \&quot;24.99\&quot;. If the currency is not included, we default to US dollars.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN item_attributes.product_type IS '&lt;&#x3D; 1000 characters. The categorization of your product based on your custom product taxonomy. Subcategories must be sent separated by \&quot; &gt; \&quot;.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN item_attributes.promotion_id IS 'A unique identifier referencing the promotion associated with this catalog item.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN item_attributes.sale_price IS 'The discounted price of the product. The sale_price must be lower than the price. It supports the following formats: \&quot;14.99 USD\&quot;, \&quot;14.99USD\&quot; and \&quot;14.99\&quot;.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN item_attributes.sale_price_effective_date IS 'Sale price effective date. Expected format: &lt;start_date&gt;/&lt;end_date&gt; (ISO 8601 format)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN item_attributes.shipping IS 'Shipping consists of one group of up to four elements, country, region, service (all optional) and price (required). All colons, even for blank values, are required.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN item_attributes.shipping_height IS 'The height of the package needed to ship the product. Ensure there is a space between the numeric string and the metric.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN item_attributes.shipping_weight IS 'The weight of the product. Ensure there is a space between the numeric string and the metric.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN item_attributes.shipping_width IS 'The width of the package needed to ship the product. Ensure there is a space between the numeric string and the metric.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN item_attributes."size" IS 'The size of the product.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN item_attributes.size_system IS 'Indicates the country&#39;s sizing system in which you are submitting your product. Must be one of the following values (upper or lowercased): &#39;US&#39;, &#39;UK&#39;, &#39;EU&#39;, &#39;DE&#39;, &#39;FR&#39;, &#39;JP&#39;, &#39;CN&#39;, &#39;IT&#39;, &#39;BR&#39;, &#39;MEX&#39;, or &#39;AU&#39;.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN item_attributes.size_type IS 'Additional description for the size. Must be one of the following values (upper or lowercased): &#39;regular&#39;, &#39;petite&#39;, &#39;plus&#39;, &#39;big_and_tall&#39;, or &#39;maternity&#39;.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN item_attributes.tax IS 'Tax consists of one group of up to four elements, country, region, rate (all required) and tax_ship (optional). All colons, even for blank values, are required.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN item_attributes.title IS '&lt;&#x3D; 500 characters. The name of the product.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN item_attributes.unit_pricing_base_measure IS 'Unit pricing base measure of the product. Expected format: &lt;base_measure&gt; &lt;unit_type&gt;';
COMMENT ON COLUMN item_attributes.unit_pricing_measure IS 'Unit pricing total measure of the product. Expected format: &lt;total_units&gt; &lt;unit_type&gt;';
COMMENT ON COLUMN item_attributes.variant_names IS 'Options for this variant. People will see these options next to your Pin and can select the one they want. List them in the order you want them displayed.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN item_attributes.variant_values IS 'Option values for this variant. People will see these options next to your Pin and can select the one they want. List them in the order you want them displayed. The order of the variant values must be consistent with the order of the variant names.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN item_attributes.additional_image_link IS '&lt;&#x3D; 2000 characters. The links to additional images for your product. Up to ten additional images can be used to show a product from different angles or to show different stages. Must begin with http:// or https://.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN item_attributes.ai_disclosures IS 'AI content disclosures for individual assets (image_link, additional_image_link, or video_link) on this item. Each entry declares which disclosure types apply to a single asset URL.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN item_attributes.image_link IS '&lt;&#x3D; 2000 characters. The links to the main product images. Images should be at least 75x75 pixels to avoid errors. Must start with http:// or https://.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN item_attributes.video_link IS '&lt;&#x3D; 2,000 characters. Hosted link to the product video. File types must be .mp4, .mov or .m4v. File size cannot exceed 2GB.';

