COMMENT ON COLUMN updatable_item_attributes.size_system IS 'Indicates the country&#39;s sizing system in which you are submitting your product. Must be one of the following values (upper or lowercased): &#39;US&#39;, &#39;UK&#39;, &#39;EU&#39;, &#39;DE&#39;, &#39;FR&#39;, &#39;JP&#39;, &#39;CN&#39;, &#39;IT&#39;, &#39;BR&#39;, &#39;MEX&#39;, or &#39;AU&#39;.';
